WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.400
Carole listens to three fictional households. Childcare and fare barriers are reported; the causes are not yet proven.

2
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:19.620
The DOH manual example links water, information and training. It teaches systems analysis, not treatment or the cause of every death.

3
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:30.560
Rosario in the ZFF case is a child aged one year and four months. Separate environment, livelihood and services; do not blame only the mother.

4
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:41.300
The resident reports receiving one time; the practice schedule shows two. Carole removes the wrong arrow. Why only one was received remains unknown.

5
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:52.800
Build two branches with sources and verification steps. Identify an unsupported arrow, correct it and retry. Peer feedback is not an assessment.

6
00:00:53.100 --> 00:01:05.380
In the ending, two branches contain evidence or honest uncertainty. Check childcare and fare with residents and staff. Five questions are not proof.
